": 1, "region": "europe"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 17565, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/wwkrw2ph3zxyi080hf4s.jpg"}, {"id": 504438, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scat86.jpg"}, {"id": 504439, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scat87.jpg"}, {"id": 504561, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scatbl.jpg"}, {"id": 504522, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scatai.jpg"}, {"id": 504440, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scat88.jpg"}, {"id": 504441, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scat89.jpg"}], "slug": "circus-games", "summary": "Ladiiiieeeees and gentlemeeeeennnnn! Children of all ages! The Greatest Show on Earth proudly presents... Circus Games! As a tiger trainer, you will have to put the tiger's through their various tracks. You have to do various stunts, like corkscrews and somersaults, on the trapeze. As a tight rope walker, you need to go from one side to the other, doing handstands and somersaults along the way. There is also a lady daredevil that you do stunts with from the back of a horse. If you do the international competition, you will have to do certain tricks for the trapeze, tight rope walker, horse trick-rider and make the tigers go through all the tricks in their routine.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/circus-games"}